{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 36, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "My recent trip to Japan was a truly unforgettable experience. From the moment I stepped off the plane, I was struck by the unique blend of traditional and modern culture that permeates every aspect of Japanese life.\n\nOne of the highlights of my trip was visiting the famous Tsukiji Fish Market in Tokyo. The bustling atmosphere and incredible array of fresh seafood on display were a feast for the senses. I was also fascinated by the ancient temples and shrines that dot the Japanese landscape, such as the serene Fushimi Inari shrine in Kyoto, famous for its thousands of vermilion torii gates.\n\nJapanese food was another highlight of my trip. I sampled a wide range of delicious dishes, from sushi and ramen to tempura and yakitori. The attention to detail and commitment to quality that Japanese chefs bring to their craft is truly impressive.\n\nAs I traveled through Japan, I was struck by the country's remarkable efficiency and organization. The trains ran like clockwork, and the people were always courteous and helpful. Despite the crowds and chaos of cities like Tokyo, I found Japan to be a remarkably peaceful and welcoming place.\n\nOverall, my trip to Japan was an incredible adventure that left me with unforgettable memories and a deep appreciation for this fascinating country. I'm already planning my next trip back!", "logprobs": [{"token": "My", "logprob": -0.536922037601471}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.003253288334235549}, {"token": " trip", "logprob": -7.152531907195225e-06}, {"token": " to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -6.437280717364047e-06}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.25508084893226624}, {"token": " truly", "logprob": -0.6661458611488342}, {"token": " unforgettable", "logprob": -0.00036638224264606833}, {"token": " experience", "logprob": -0.0002